Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.15,0:00:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A longship cuts through the fog,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.76,0:00:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,its striped sail rising over the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.37,0:00:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.81,0:00:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So where did the Vikings actually
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.42,0:00:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.29,0:00:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mostly from Scandinavia—the\Nregions we now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.14,0:00:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,call Norway, Denmark, and Sweden.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.51,0:00:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But there was no single Viking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.12,0:00:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.56,0:00:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,During the Viking Age, roughly the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.17,0:00:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,late eighth to eleventh centuries,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.34,0:00:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Scandinavians sailed abroad to\Nraid, trade,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.95,0:00:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,explore, and settle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Some headed west to Britain,\NIceland,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.87,0:00:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Greenland,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.30,0:00:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and eventually North America.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.05,0:00:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Others traveled east along rivers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.22,0:00:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,toward the Baltic, Byzantium, and\Nbeyond.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.83,0:00:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So the Vikings did not emerge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.44,0:00:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,from one mysterious homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.18,0:00:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They came from different\NScandinavian societies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,“Viking” wasn’t simply where\Nsomeone was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.41,0:00:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,from—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.84,0:00:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,it was connected to what some
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.45,0:00:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Scandinavians went out into the\Nworld
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.06,0:00:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.93,0:00:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,it was connected to what some
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.54,0:00:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Scandinavians went out into the\Nworld
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.16,0:00:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,to do.
